### Feature Customers — CREATE (JWT + RBAC)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
# access_token: POST /api/sesion/login (features/auth/session/http/session.http) o npm run dev:token -- admin
@token = pega-aqui-el-access-token

### CREATE → 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/clientes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "business_name": "Hotel Waya Guajira",
  "tax_id": "900123456-7",
  "contact_name": "Laura Epieyú",
  "phone": "3001234567",
  "email": "compras@hotelwaya.com",
  "address": "Calle 1 #4-50, Riohacha"
}

### CREATE con NIT repetido → 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/clientes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "business_name": "Otro hotel",
  "tax_id": "900123456-7",
  "phone": "3007654321",
  "email": "otro@hotel.com"
}
